<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-SCOTLAND 56-1 V IRELAND WHEN RAIN STOPS PLAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOTLAND 56-1 V IRELAND WHEN RAIN STOPS PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland were 56-1 after</p>
<p>19 overs in their International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy</p>
<p>third-place match against Ireland on Thursday when rain stopped</p>
<p>play.</p>
<p>The match will resume on Friday.</p>
</text>
